 "result": "The failing call is at `src/tessel/sessions.py:374`, inside `persist_session`. It is the `response.set_cookie(...)` call, which starts on that line and spans the keyword arguments below it.\n\nThe argument the installed Werkzeug 3.0.3 rejects is `partitioned=partitioned`. The value comes from `self.get_cookie_partitioned(app)` a few lines earlier in the same method. Werkzeug 3.0.3's `Response.set_cookie()` has no `partitioned` parameter, so it raises `TypeError: Response.set_cookie() got an unexpected keyword argument 'partitioned'`.",
